From 4d631c2436812bc943eaae339412ff85b620a1b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaeliGlow <caeliglow@mockifylab.local>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:00:44 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] caeliglow: native Settings About section with animated logo +
 live update check

Adds a "CaeliGlow" Settings section that shows the version, the Noctalia base
release and MIT attribution, headed by the animated crescent-moon mark, with a
live "Check for updates" button.

- The About header renders the bundled animated GIF (assets/caeliglow/
  logo-animated.gif): frames are decoded once into GPU textures and cycled by a
  self-re-arming Timer, mirroring Noctalia's desktop-sticker GIF playback. The
  Image node is re-attached across content rebuilds; the loop stops when leaving
  the section and textures are freed on window close; falls back to the static
  first frame if the GIF cannot be decoded.
- The update button issues a single unauthenticated GET to the GitHub releases
  endpoint via Noctalia's async HttpClient and renders the result with the
  unit-tested caeliglow/update_model decision logic. Gated by shell.offlineMode;
  release notes are plain text and never executed.
- CAELIGLOW_VERSION is now read from the repository-root VERSION file at
  configure time (meson run_command) so it is the single source of truth.
---
 assets/caeliglow/logo-animated.gif            | Bin 0 -> 84826 bytes
 assets/translations/en.json                   |   1 +
 meson.build                                   |  10 +
 src/app/application_ui.cpp                    |   1 +
 src/caeliglow/meta.hpp                        |  34 +++
 src/caeliglow/update_model.hpp                | 199 ++++++++++++++
 src/caeliglow/version.hpp                     | 151 +++++++++++
 src/shell/settings/settings_content.cpp       |   7 +-
 src/shell/settings/settings_content_about.cpp | 255 ++++++++++++++++++
 src/shell/settings/settings_content_about.h   |  34 +++
 src/shell/settings/settings_registry.cpp      |   3 +-
 src/shell/settings/settings_registry.h        |   1 +
 src/shell/settings/settings_window.cpp        |   1 +
 src/shell/settings/settings_window.h          |  27 ++
 src/shell/settings/settings_window_scene.cpp  |  28 ++
 15 files changed, 748 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 assets/caeliglow/logo-animated.gif
 create mode 100644 src/caeliglow/meta.hpp
 create mode 100644 src/caeliglow/update_model.hpp
 create mode 100644 src/caeliglow/version.hpp
 create mode 100644 src/shell/settings/settings_content_about.cpp
 create mode 100644 src/shell/settings/settings_content_about.h

